    "sections": {
        "description": "The Multi Review Blog Theme is designed for affiliate-focused websites that publish product listings, comparison articles, reviews, and promotional content. The layout includes structured sections for featured products, banners, call-to-action areas, and categorized content display. It supports responsive design, allowing pages to adapt across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. The theme includes customizable homepage settings, multiple page templates, widget-ready areas, navigation menus, and blog layouts for organizing articles and product-related content. Built-in customization options allow changes to colors, typography, headers, and background settings without modifying core files. It also supports social media integration, search functionality, and basic SEO-friendly coding practices to improve content visibility. Compatibility with common plugins allows additional features such as contact forms, newsletter integration, and analytics tools. The clean layout structure helps maintain readability for long-form articles and product-focused pages. Fast-loading design elements and organized content sections make it suitable for websites that regularly publish affiliate content, promotional updates, tutorials, and review-based posts across different categories."
    },
